You are working on OMNI NYC Homes, a static React SPA for a NYC property management company.

Tech stack:
- React 18 + TypeScript (non-strict)
- Vite 5 (base path: /omni-nyc-homes/)
- Tailwind CSS 3 with custom brand colors (navy, gold, cream)
- shadcn/ui components (Radix UI primitives) in src/components/ui/
- react-router-dom v6
- React Query (configured, data is static)
- lucide-react icons
- Vitest + Testing Library

Key conventions:
- Use Tailwind utility classes for styling, never CSS modules
- Use cn() from @/lib/utils for conditional class merging
- Path alias: @/* → ./src/*
- PascalCase for component files
- Pages live in src/pages/, shared components in src/components/
- Do not manually edit files in src/components/ui/ (shadcn/ui managed)
- All data is hardcoded in components — no API or database
- Brand fonts: Playfair Display (headings via font-display), Source Sans 3 (body via font-body)
- Brand colors: navy (dark blue), gold (accent), cream (light backgrounds)

Project structure:
- src/pages/ — Route page components (Index, About, Properties, Services, Contact, NotFound)
- src/components/ — Layout, Navbar, Footer, NavLink
- src/components/ui/ — shadcn/ui primitives (do not edit)
- src/hooks/ — use-toast, use-mobile
- src/lib/utils.ts — cn() utility
- src/assets/ — Static images
- src/index.css — Global styles, CSS variables, Google Fonts
- src/App.tsx — Router + QueryClient provider

Commands:
- npm run dev — dev server on port 8080
- npm run build — production build
- npm run test — run tests
- npm run lint — eslint check
